Byte wide write enable (BWWE) is not inferred for Block RAM u_harness/g_vec[4].mem_reg_0_bram_3 because address width (14) is more than optimal threshold of 12. Implementing using BWWE will require more logic and timing would be suboptimal. Please use attribute ram_decomp = power if BWWE is desired..
